Subject: [PATCH mptcp-next 04/12] mptcp: drop the mptcp_ooo_try_coalesce() helper
Date: Sat,  9 May 2026 09:48:24 +0200
Message-ID: <b506e5d31d458b0e7247f4f18fbd8f92d1a56d62.1778312843.git.pabeni@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1778312843.git.pabeni@redhat.com>
